  "title": "Paleo Granola",
  "description": "Granola gets a paleo makeover in this easy recipe with almonds, pecans, walnuts, and sesame seeds coated in spiced honey butter.",
  "authors": [
    "Britt H"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-09-07T02:35:01-04:00",
